        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based, strategic puzzle game about creating and expanding companies and trading stocks! It combines strategic depth elements of chess with a fun and challenging stock trading experience. Wisely place tiles on the board to force lucrative mergers. You may want to invest in the involved companies first though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/431430e2176d98bcfdb9dcf2d0b9cdb9.poster.avif?t=1789083061\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/431430e2176d98bcfdb9dcf2d0b9cdb9.webm?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/431430e2176d98bcfdb9dcf2d0b9cdb9.mp4?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles and missions on pre-defined maps vs other competitors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn in-game rewards (Achievements, Leaderboards, Levels, Ranks)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your gameplay experience with different card backs and other cosmetics, unlockable through gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/d60e628efe621ff3ef6689345b76988b.poster.avif?t=1789083061\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/d60e628efe621ff3ef6689345b76988b.webm?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/d60e628efe621ff3ef6689345b76988b.mp4?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based, strategic puzzle game about creating and expanding companies and trading stocks! It combines strategic depth elements of chess with a fun and challenging stock trading experience. Wisely place tiles on the board to force lucrative mergers. You may want to invest in the involved companies first though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/431430e2176d98bcfdb9dcf2d0b9cdb9.poster.avif?t=1789083061\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/431430e2176d98bcfdb9dcf2d0b9cdb9.webm?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/431430e2176d98bcfdb9dcf2d0b9cdb9.mp4?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles and missions on pre-defined maps vs other competitors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn in-game rewards (Achievements, Leaderboards, Levels, Ranks)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your gameplay experience with different card backs and other cosmetics, unlockable through gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/d60e628efe621ff3ef6689345b76988b.poster.avif?t=1789083061\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/d60e628efe621ff3ef6689345b76988b.webm?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746610/extras/d60e628efe621ff3ef6689345b76988b.mp4?t=1789083061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
